<!-- Indonesian. Note the folder is values-in, not values-id: Android still
     uses the legacy ISO code "in" for Indonesian, and a values-id folder is
     silently ignored at runtime.

     Model tier names (Swift, Balanced, Precise, Ultra, Core, Max) are left in
     English on purpose — they are product tiers, not prose, and they have to
     match what the Play listing and support answers call them. -->
